;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those 75 years. In 2025, January to February was 49% of normal and August to September was 50% on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 201% of normal there. Grid 25980 had its driest year in 1953 at 69% of normal.</p>"}
